      "page": 13,
      "snippet": "This device does not have internal configuration or status registers. Instead, read or write to the device I/Os directly after sending the device address"
    },
    {
      "source_id": "pcf8574",
      "page": 13,
      "snippet": "The data byte follows the address acknowledge. If the R/ W bit is high, the data from this device are the values read from the P port."
    },
    {
